# "When that mana is spent ..." is a delayed triggered ability the mana ability creates as it resolves (CR 603.7a, 106.3),
# riding the mana, not an ability of Path of Ancestry: Path destroyed by Wasteland while its {W} floats still makes Elite
# Vanguard (Human Soldier, like Kytheon) cast with that {W} scry 1. The scry bottoms Mountain, leaving Island on top.
